  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Associazione Consorzio Cantiere Cuccagna is an organization that collaborates with EMERGENCY to realize the Hub di Aiuto Alimentare, contributing to food distribution and social inclusion initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Associazione Consorzio Cantiere Cuccagna is an organization that collaborates with Fondazione ALIA Falck and La Mescolanza Impresa Sociale on the Radici di Comunità project, focusing on urban regeneration and social inclusion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Associazione Consorzio Cantiere Cuccagna is the lead organization behind the Food Hub Cuccagna project."</data>
