  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EMERGENCY is an organization collaborating with the Food Hub Cuccagna as part of its initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"EMERGENCY is an organization that operates the Hub di Aiuto Alimentare in Cascina Cuccagna, focusing on social inclusion and providing essential services to vulnerable communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emergency is an organization involved in mobile support services in Milan, highlighted in RECUP's events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emergency is an organization that coordinated the Nessuno Escluso project, which Nessunə Esclusə APS Scighera participated in to support families in need."</data>
