<node id="&quot;RECUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RECUP is a food recovery organization based in Milan."&lt;SEP&gt;"RECUP is an organization based in Italy, Milan, Municipio 5, focused on reducing food waste by recovering unsold food and redistributing it to the public, saving CO2 emissions and reaching thousands of people annually."&lt;SEP&gt;"RECUP is an organization involved in food recovery in Milan."&lt;SEP&gt;"RECUP is an organization involved in food waste reduction, collaborating with APS Fucine Vulcano to collect surplus food at markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recup is an organization involved in the Food Hub Cuccagna project, contributing to food recovery efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recup is an organization involved in the collection and redistribution of food surpluses in collaboration with other entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recup is an organization involved in the recovery and redistribution of food waste, collaborating with Aiuto Alimentare Foody Zero Sprechi."</data>
