<node id="&quot;FONDAZIONE CARIPLO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fondazione Cariplo is a foundation supporting the 'Dispositivo Aiuto Alimentare' initiative, working alongside the Comune di Milano and other organizations to address food insecurity in Milan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a foundation supporting the Food Hub Cuccagna through funding and collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a foundation that financially supports the Aiuto Alimentare Foody Zero Sprechi project, collaborating with the Comune di Milano to fund the hub's operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a foundation that provides financial support for community projects, including the BiblioBiG library."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a foundation that supports Milan's Food Policy initiatives, particularly the fight against food waste and poverty. It has been a key supporter of the Selinunte Hub project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a funding organization supporting the Nutrire Milano project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a funding organization that supports the 'Milano 2035' project, including the LabBarona Repair Cafè."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is a partner organization that supported the restoration of the agricultural courtyard of Abbazia di Mirasole through the Art Bonus program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is an Italian foundation that has supported the Fondazione Bertini Malgarini Onlus in the G.EN.TE. project and other initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo is an organization that funds and supports projects in environmental, cultural, social, and research areas to generate positive impacts and improve community quality of life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondazione Cariplo supports the Hub Foody Zero Sprechi financially and collaborates with the City of Milan on its initiatives."</data>
