  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A municipal district within Milan, Italy, where Orto Comune Niguarda is situated according to the provided coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is a district in Milan, Italy, where City Angels is based and operates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is a district in Milan, Italy, where Progetto Arca is based."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is a municipal district in Milan, Italy, where Banco Alimentare is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is a municipal district in Milan, Italy, with coordinates 45.5, 9.19. It is the location associated with the URL https://www.fuoriedentro.it/."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the administrative district in Milan where the Food Hub Cuccagna is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the administrative district in Milan where the hub is situated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the administrative district in Milan, Italy, where Giardino degli Aromi is situated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the administrative district in Milan, Italy, where Parco Nord Milano is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the administrative district in Milan, Italy, where the food distribution event is organized."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the municipal district in Milan where the Casa dei Tigli is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the specific administrative district in Milan where Coltivando is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the specific administrative district in Milan where Equoevento is based, focusing on its mission to reduce food waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Municipio 9 is the specific administrative district in Milan, Italy, where Eufemia is located."</data>
