  <data key="d1">"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a geographical area in Milan involved in approving the structural works for the 'Hortus Conclusus' project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a geographical area in Milan, Italy, associated with the DESR organization and the AMAP project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a large agricultural park in the Milan metropolitan area, covering 181.8 km² and home to over 1,000 active farms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a park that promotes connections between urban and rural areas, and Associazione Nocetum is part of this park."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a regional park and organization involved in the Nutrire Milano project, providing a framework for agricultural production and distribution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parco Agricolo Sud Milano is a southern agricultural park in Milan that actively promotes local agriculture and urban gardening projects."</data>
