  <data key="d1">"Anna Scavuzzo is the Vicesindaco (Deputy Mayor) of Milan with responsibility for Food Policy, who emphasized the importance of the new hub in transforming food waste into a structural resource."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anna Scavuzzo is the Vicesindaco (Deputy Mayor) of Milan, responsible for Food Policy, highlighting the collaboration between AMAT and the city's departments to improve food aid distribution efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anna Scavuzzo is the Vicesindaco of Milan and was present at the inauguration of Agrivis's Cascina."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anna Scavuzzo is the Vicesindaco with responsibility for Food Policy in the City of Milan, emphasizing the importance of the Hub Foody Zero Sprechi project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anna Scavuzzo is the vicesindaca (deputy mayor) of Milan with responsibility for Food Policy. She has been instrumental in advancing initiatives like the Selinunte Hub to address food waste and poverty."</data>
