  <data key="d1">"A broader Catholic charity organization in Milan, connected to the Caritas Parrocchiale and providing support for managing the Centro d’Ascolto."&lt;SEP&gt;"A charitable organization with listening centers that collaborates with San Vincenzo in the historic center of Milan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A religious and charitable organization collaborating with the Emporio, providing guidance and oversight through its representatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization that collaborates with Fondazione La Rotonda ETS to create the Emporio della Solidarietà."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization with listening centers that collaborates with Conferenze San Vincenzo in the historic center for charitable activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caritas Ambrosiana is a broader charitable organization associated with the Diocesi di Milano, working in collaboration with Caritas parrocchiale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caritas Ambrosiana is a charitable organization involved in the 'Dispositivo Aiuto Alimentare' initiative, collaborating with the Comune di Milano to provide food aid during the Coronavirus emergency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caritas Ambrosiana is a network of charitable organizations in the Lombardy region, managing Empori della Solidarietà in Niguarda and Lambrate for food distribution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caritas Ambrosiana is an organization based in Milan, Italy, focused on promoting human development, social justice, and peace, with particular attention to marginalized communities. It engages in projects, fundraising, training, and volunteer activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caritas Ambrosiana is associated with the Refettorio Ambrosiano, as indicated in the title, and likely supports its mission of promoting human dignity through solidarity and art."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f20cbc0ffc2c4dba23fa6e3470515b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4facf8a7b8c657be8a687d6d6849cab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d295c925a445e85b5cac8bf5794fcca1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8256cd4c06304de10905fea0306b6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef9769a6e6ac67d0d16c1f1e4fef6177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b2335269f1bef21cd28f2277353b316&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d092fc7044fb6b7fbcc7281230b82cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b313e616751bb0128e8116f9c59c56c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316841c1702e9181c0877fb8ba062c9c</data>
