<node id="&quot;BANCO ALIMENTARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Banco Alimentare is a food bank operating in Italy, focused on recovering food for those in need. It was established in 1989 and operates through a network of 7,645 local partner organizations, 2,071 stable volunteers, and 21 regional offices. It has recovered 93,745 tons of food and helped 1,755,857 people in 2024."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an Italian organization that operates food banks, established in 1989 with its first warehouse in Meda, Lombardy, and expanded across Italy and Europe."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an organization collaborating with La Casa di Redenzione Sociale to distribute food packages, operating in Milan's Municipio 9."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an organization focused on collecting and redistributing food surpluses to combat food waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an organization that participates in the recovery and redistribution of food waste, working alongside Aiuto Alimentare Foody Zero Sprechi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an organization that provides food supplies to Fondazione Arché as part of their partnership, adhering to guidelines set by Agea."&lt;SEP&gt;"Banco Alimentare is an organization that provides food supplies to Fondazione Arché, adhering to guidelines from Agea and participating in the distribution of food to beneficiaries."</data>
