  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cena dell'Amicizia ODV is a volunteer association based in Milan, Italy, established in 1968. It focuses on meeting, welcoming, and reintegrating individuals in severe social marginalization, particularly homeless men and women. The organization relies on volunteers of all ages, including students, workers, and retirees."</data>
