<node id="&quot;EQUOEVENTO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Equoevento is a non-profit organization founded in 2014 in Rome, Italy, dedicated to reducing food waste by recovering surplus food from events and donating it to charitable meals. It specializes in food recovery from weddings, congresses, sports events, and other gatherings, and partners with various organizations and institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equoevento is an organization that supports event organizers, catering services, and private individuals by promoting their services through an online platform, utilizing food waste, and providing ethical branding opportunities."</data>
