<node id="&quot;EUFEMIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eufemia is a community-led food-sharing initiative in Milan, Italy, focused on distributing agro-ecological and organic products through collective decision-making. It also operates as a multifunctional space offering social dining, educational workshops, cultural events, and opportunities for marginalized individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eufemia is a volunteer who has been involved with VIDAS for 22 years, starting as a home helper, then in hospice care, and later leading the 'Ratatouille' volunteer cooking group."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eeef52b8285a30cce8a8a08d34938e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a724b449d74c7184b42be8cb050db8</data>
