<node id="&quot;SOCIAL MARKET NORD MILANO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Social Market Nord Milano is a food bank established in 2015 that supports people and families in temporary economic difficulty by providing access to essential goods through a self-service model, operating in collaboration with local partners and funded by donations and contributions from organizations like Fondazione Auprema."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f39ea3cf6b7a9f10d2f26a72e26bbcc</data>
