<node id="&quot;HUMANA PEOPLE TO PEOPLE ITALIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An organization focused on sustainability, upcycling, and social impact, collaborating with various partners on events and projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is a branch of Humana focused on educational interventions in India, particularly in Bihar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is a branch of the global Humana People to People organization, focused on development programs in Italy and other regions, emphasizing sustainability, community building, and environmental impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is a non-profit organization focused on social and environmental impact, participating in the project to promote sustainable fashion and ethical consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is an organization involved in social initiatives, retail, and participation in events like Ecomondo, focusing on sustainability, second-hand clothing, and combating gender-based violence through Punti Viola."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is an organization involved in textile reuse, environmental protection, and social projects, operating globally and in Italy for over 40 years and 25 years respectively."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia is an organization that partners with Personal Bra Ladies and CityModa for campaigns involving the collection and redistribution of used clothing, as well as supporting social and environmental projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humana People to People Italia manages community gardens like the 3C project, organizes upcycling workshops, and participates in global events such as the European Development Days."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7f9f7339900022472e4e07355df90b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba15b2b131d028510c42194aca2ad615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b318599ffce1928151c0e665f3e878a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71aa00bdc13b6b80f24c192f322d3529&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e7c8679f2b1ce212567d07eea76869&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3d7d10ff7257efa49e15550c8f65d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fb001693f1f8b66dc5f1f825c7d6d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9517dc8bc76e067cc9a0d96911209d7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 192}]</data>
