<node id="&quot;INGALERA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"InGalera is a gourmet restaurant located within the Bollate prison in Milan, Italy. It provides employment opportunities for detainees, offering them professional training and a pathway to reintegration into society through culinary work. The restaurant is open to the public and is managed by professional chefs and maîtres, with detainees participating in food preparation."</data>
