<node id="&quot;MUNICIPIO 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">The comprehensive summary of the data provided is as follows:

Municipio 5 is a municipal district in Milan, Italy, that encompasses various organizations, initiatives, and locations. It is described as a district in Milan where APS Fucine Vulcano, RECUP, Agrivis's Cascina, EAT Educational project, IBVA, CSA-Milano initiative, Cooperativa Madre Terra, Gustop, Opera Cardinal Ferrari, Associazione Parco Agricolo Sud Milano, DESR organization, Giardino delle Meraviglie, and other entities are located. The district is also associated with the CSA initiatives in the area and is an administrative division within Milan, Italy.

Municipio 5 is a hub for various social and environmental activities, including urban gardening, temporary food aid distribution, and the promotion of projects such as AMAP and Hortus Conclusus. It is also home to several organizations that focus on sustainability, solidarity, and community development.

The district's coordinates are 45.42, 9.2, and it is situated within the city of Milan, Italy. The municipal district in Milan where the Emporio della Solidarietà is located is also referred to as Municipio 5.

In summary, Municipio 5 is a vibrant and diverse district in Milan, Italy, that serves as a hub for various social, environmental, and community initiatives.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38562ffdf247d25274b9fa9ce5f44588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef4540deb1b9d669fb55a64b77cbaca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaaaf662bef5eb0ade055d4e0172711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a740b964e159a1d9bbe1360175c355&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289d76a8cdebcb9beee41a1365a0bba2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be2237746cb0b2b1efcf00574f20a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5c415ada9f9a18878c1ced03c18395b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9204fe249d282d013a9f1345987f3b73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1245c4c1862103ccfdbdb33f3c1f8919&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f20cbc0ffc2c4dba23fa6e3470515b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b069733317f5749f57de218b2bf508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af3b9e72a6a52e4140398a046817f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fe8112056346855c600b68788fbe05a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66b1e515ecc5c00c2a098777743253d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415cf2ad7bdd1207e9b6e41dccb2654f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b313e616751bb0128e8116f9c59c56c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e73ce7a64c01805cff312c71043bcab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06a29593501dd9f361706c7d4ed8bb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d295c925a445e85b5cac8bf5794fcca1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ecb9b6f44109e8b8a517bd87c930f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380c79f132ac82cac8e3d6756d99dee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7dd7217d7ddefc7ed67e65635e246</data>
